    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d732">

                <pb facs="1081" n="981" sameAs="frus:frus1934v01/pg981"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.42157SA29/1328½</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">President Roosevelt to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1934-12-29">December 29,
                        1934</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>What has happened in regard to the old proposed Treaty with Canada<anchor n="74"
                        xml:id="d732-f1"/> in regard to the use of additional water at Niagara
                    Falls? I think it was sent to the Senate by President Hoover but died there.
                    Will you speak to me about this when we take up the St. Lawrence Treaty?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>F[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ranklin</hi>] D. R[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">oosevelt</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
